Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:28:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add unified runtime module: cloud detection,
 resource-sandboxed subprocess runner, stage instrumentation

Single source of truth for shared-cloud detection (replacing four duplicated
copies), a run_guarded() helper that launches native tools under enforced
RLIMIT_AS/RLIMIT_CPU ceilings in their own process group (so a runaway child is
killed by the kernel and surfaces as a catchable ChildResourceError instead of
OOM-killing the whole Streamlit worker), and a stage() context manager that logs
start/end/elapsed/RSS-delta and child exit status to stderr for Cloud-log
diagnosis. Degrades gracefully off POSIX; skips address-space limiting for the
Go 'datasets' binary which reserves large virtual memory.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
